@startuml
' What: the worked example of Appendix A.6 (5): one generation in HG 12 Standstill.
' Shows: lines 3 and 5 tremble; with most "Own the shame" and least "It's over, relax" the realm heads to HG 33;
'        had line 5 been left to the dice and flipped, to HG 56. HG 11 Peace is the antipode of HG 12 (all 6 lines differ).
' Source: brainstorming-base.md, Appendix A.5, A.6, §4 "The I Ching as a state space".
title Worked example: one generation in HG 12 Standstill
state "HG 12 Standstill\n(Earth below, Heaven above)" as HG12
state "HG 33 Retreat\n(Mountain below, Heaven above)" as HG33
state "HG 56 The Wanderer\n(Mountain below, Fire above)" as HG56
state "HG 11 Peace\n(Heaven below, Earth above)" as HG11
[*] --> HG12
HG12 --> HG33 : most "Own the shame": line 3 changes\nleast "It's over, relax": line 5 held\n(ego down twice)
HG12 --> HG56 : line 3 changes,\nline 5 unmarked and flipped by the dice
HG12 -[dashed]-> HG11 : Hamming distance 6\n(antipodes)
note right of HG12 : lines 3 and 5 tremble
@enduml
